# clic_calib engineering rules (summary)
# Full text: project CURSOR_MASTER_PROMPT.md §0–§4

- Backbone: split SO(3)+R^3 cumulative cubic B-spline; knot interval Δt.
- Optimize UAV T_WB(t); roadside T_CW, T_LW static; RTK absolute position (not preintegration).
- Ceres trajectory factors: analytic Jacobians only + GTest 1e-6 checks.
- Frames: T_XY maps p_X = T_XY * p_Y. Lever arms from config/lever_arms.yaml, not optimized in main pipeline.
- Do not delete legacy code; move to legacy_clic/.
- catkin / ROS Noetic; headers in include/clic_calib/, sources in src/clic_calib/.
